Modifications
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following significant changes were made to the original Buzz work, as
required by Section 4(b) of the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  * Rebranded the product from "Buzz" to "HireShelby" across user-facing
    surfaces, documentation, and application metadata.
  * Changed the desktop application bundle identifier from "xyz.block.buzz.app"
    to "com.hireshelby.app".
  * Changed the deep-link URL scheme from "buzz://" to "hireshelby://".
  * Repointed release, update, and download endpoints away from Block, Inc.
    infrastructure to HireShelby-controlled endpoints.
  * Changed the security contact address and project governance.
  * Removed references to Block, Inc. internal build, deployment, and release
    infrastructure.

